OL,3,GNEWSAWoman dies and man critically
OL,4,Ainjured after crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman has died and a man is in
OL,7,Fhospital with life-threatening injuries
OL,8,Ffollowing a crash.
OL,10,FHampshire Police said it was called to
OL,11,Freports of a serious crash involving
OL,12,Ftwo vehicles on the A3057, between the
OL,13,FA303 junction and Cowdown Lane near
OL,14,FAndover, just after 17:45 BST on
OL,15,FFriday.
OL,17,FThe crash involved a light coloured
OL,18,FFiat Punto and a dark coloured Toyota
OL,19,FLand Cruiser, which were travelling in
OL,20,Fopposite directions at the time of the
OL,21,Fincident.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
