OL,3,GNEWSAWoman dies and man critically
OL,4,Ainjured after crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA passenger from one of the vehicles, a
OL,7,F76-year-old woman, was taken to
OL,8,Fhospital with serious injuries, where
OL,9,Fshe later died. An 80-year-old man also
OL,10,Fsuffered life-threatening injuries and
OL,11,Fremains in hospital.
